## Example With Custom Logic

```java
@Bean(name = "customFlow")
public Flow customFlow(@Qualifier("teamAVectorStore") VectorStore teamAVectorStore) {
    return new BaseFlow("custom_flow", "Provide custom steps:", teamAVectorStore, null, "detailed") {
        @Override
        public String execute(String userInput, String sessionId, DynamicPromptService promptService, LlmService llmService) {
            String extraInfo = "Custom logic here";
            String dynamicPrompt = promptService.buildPrompt(userInput, null, getTemplateName(), 
                                                           getVectorStore(), getKnowledgeStore(), sessionId);
            String finalPrompt = getPromptText() + "\n" + dynamicPrompt + "\n" + extraInfo;
            return llmService.executePrompt(finalPrompt, sessionId);
        }
    };
}
```

- Only `execute` is overridden; no getter duplication.

